<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10886" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνύποπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without suspicion,</i>
			i.e., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>unsuspected,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.43
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				5.3.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεηλασίαι</span>”
				<i>unexpected,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Tact.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>unsuspectedly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					10.20
				</span></i>
			, al., <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				666
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>free from risk,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίνησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.55
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάνατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Sto.Herc.</u>
					339.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>unsuspecting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράξεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					8.27.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Brut.</u>
				8
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.146
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Top.</u>
					156b18
				</span></i>
			; <i>unhesitatingly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.614b
			</span></i>.</div>
